 🚑 OMass Therapeutics , a U.K. biotech that uses structural mass spectrometry, raised $310m in Series C funding. Bain Capital Life Sciences , Forbion , and Novo Holdings led, joined by Janus Henderson, SV Health Investors, Jefferson Life Sciences and insiders Syncona, Oxford Science Enterprises, GV, Northpond Ventures, Sanofi Ventures, British Patient Capital, and University of Oxford. axios.link/4yqX8j0 

 • North , an NYC-based cloud spend startup, raised $60m in Series B funding, per Axios Pro . PeakSpan Capital led, joined by Litquidity, Companyon Ventures, Alpaca, Uncommon Denominator, Gaingels, and Mana Ventures. axios.link/4B6DmMf 

 • ZenZap , a workplace messaging app, raised $44m from Bessemer, Lightspeed, and The Garage. axios.link/4i0iAFa 

 🚑 Altay Therapeutics , a San Carlos, Calif.-based developer of transcription factor small molecule inhibitors, raised $37m in Series A funding. Sound Bioventures and HealthCap led, joined by Fountain Healthcare Partners, Biogen New Ventures, Pappas Capital, and Global BioAccess Fund. axios.link/4sdQcUY 

 • Sunbound , a Phoenix-based provider of back-office solutions for senior living operators, raised $24m in Series A funding and acquired billing firm Richter Healthcare Consultants, per Axios Pro . TTV Capital led, joined by Bling Capital, Fika Ventures, Live Oak Bank, and Ziegler Linkage Fund. axios.link/4zAN8oh 

 • Sharp Performance , a coaching platform for first responders, raised $18m in Series A funding, per Axios Pro . Hidden Variable led, joined by a16z, Commonweal Ventures, Wolfson Group, FJ Labs, and Ford Foundation. axios.link/4i5npgJ 

 • CarbonAI , a CRE loan underwriting platform, raised $12m from Cowboy Ventures, Bling Capital, Max Ventures, and Timber Grove Ventures, per Axios Pro . axios.link/4dGrnLi 

 • Chariot Claims , an NYC-based consumer protection claims platform, raised $10m in Series A funding. Silverton Partners led, joined by Indicator Ventures, Lightbank, Neon Fund, ZVC, Rosecliff Venture Partners, Alumni Ventures, FJ Labs, Graph Ventures, and Vermilion Ventures. axios.link/4zubFLx 

 • Harbor , a provider of software to assess agentic AI risk at financial institutions, raised $10m in seed funding from Base10 Partners, Abstract, and 8VC, per Axios Pro . axios.link/3TOvRsx 

 • Aatmunn , a Detroit-based industrial intelligence provider, raised $8m led by Memento Growth Partners . axios.link/4s4w7An 

 • Othello , an NYC-based AI model developer for live sales calls, raised an $8m seed round from a16z, Owl Capital, and Long Journey Ventures. axios.link/4s7Xfym 

 🌎 Molagri, a Canadian developer of biopesticides, raised US$5.8m in pre-seed and seed funding. Convective Capital led, joined by Superorganism, YC, and Julian Capital. axios.link/4s57BPr 

 🌎 Ambio , a Finnish plastics procurement startup, raised €5.1m in seed funding. B2venture led, joined by Montis and Lifeline Ventures. axios.link/4i1Pi9k 

 • Holo , a Lithuanian AI marketing platform, raised €5m in seed funding. Market One Capital led, joined by Silicon Gardens, FirstPick, Leonis Capital, NGL, and Tekton Ventures. axios.link/4sa7ceH 

 🌎 OlsAro , a Swedish developer of resilient wheat, raised €5m in seed funding. Industrifonden and Nordic Foodtech VC led, joined by Future Food Fund, PINC, AgFunder, and GU Ventures. axios.link/4jsis3T 

 • Marklo , an SF-based agentic marketing platform, raised a $5m seed round. Forerunner led, joined by Freestyle Capital. axios.link/3TYJTYE 

 🚀 KP Labs , a Polish satellite data processing startup, raised €4.4m from Momentum Capital Partners . axios.link/4B7urde 

 • CodeWall , a London-based cybersecurity testing platform, raised $4m in pre-seed funding. Osney Capital led, joined by InReach Ventures and Antler. axios.link/4ikWy1c 

 🚑 Silvia Bio , a U.K. biomanufacturing startup, raised £3m in seed funding. Northern Gritstone led, joined by Parkwalk Northern Universities Venture Fund, and the UK Innovation &amp; Science Seed Fund. axios.link/3U1aOmt 

